  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* fix: do not initialize old dprint-plugin-gofumpt versions twice (#1308)\r\n* test: start up all known plugins on the CI (#1309)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|9b38610df23417c5cce6daa7d9fb43d9960a5f859fa91cbe7c12f11198074900|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|3fbf19db032dea2e8eb6e52eebbc8c328954a46d52ffd97d99a95b9c9b81414f|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|f259df6beed31a7242a613cf1ff948637ca17d1b385f8effa2cfbf6a056ff84c|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|ebc76aace124258db76ac3501bcbcaa182cd615956e5c7311b54b6059a80f9eb|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|061f0c0790de5e6758c73c0d2639f698b9802c1bb5c6c70124c5ebb112b1afce|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|c33d901d2f5b81af680bce50902e7193e6c169f4f2dd6e1d41d3c5a96d70ecb4|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|b85ad46a2e8e686b4ff1ff1dc1f0a0f947e766df5afb08ce367cb0d152dff616|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|6585c1a475e995cbd3729e039579c6fef9f28202c3b94bf252ab04f8f4177876|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|d0658fcc2887fe8ba396f6ef0fec28c97a6d59558835b7b82e573ea923c53b25|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|c5af6a12fbecd25c858af69910dc0f4791552c913b8b73293d44ab00d6a1b71b|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|fc015e872f00d89675d90ed950c6e91de9c712580dab5077be6f41b0caf5a96f|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|cf7af7c011e29477569523a8c3ea17167a844c3e536c134319ec30d